ainPriest_Scourge</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:WPN_GOB_PainPriest_Scourge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:WPN_GOB_PainPriest_Scourge\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">b1dc33ba-c595-4036-9683-26635f297e44</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:b1dc33ba-c595-4036-9683-26635f297e44\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:b1dc33ba-c595-4036-9683-26635f297e44\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>Stats</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">GOB_PainPriest_Scourge</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:GOB_PainPriest_Scourge+type:stat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:GOB_PainPriest_Scourge+type:stat\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></dd></dl>\n</div> \n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Special\"> Special </span></h3>\n<p><b>The holder of this item gains:</b>\n\n</p>\n<dl><dt><a href=\"/wiki/Willing_Whip\" title=\"Willing Whip\">Willing Whip</a></dt><dd>Grants <a href=\"/wiki/Resistance\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Resistance\">Resistance</a> to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Necrotic\" title=\"Necrotic\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Necrotic\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Necrotic\" title=\"Necrotic\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-necrotic\">Necrotic</span></a> damage. Deals an additional <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-necrotic\">1d6</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Necrotic\" title=\"Necrotic\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Necrotic\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Necrotic\" title=\"Necrotic\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-necrotic\">Necrotic</span></a><abbr title=\"Damage Rider As Source\" class=\"bg3wiki-damage-rider-source\"><a href=\"/wiki/Damage_rider_as_source\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Damage rider as source\">DRS</a></abbr> damage to nearby targets, including the wielder.</dd></dl>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Weapon_actions\"> Weapon actions </span></h3>\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2d/Proficiency_Icon.png/22px-Proficiency_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/2d/Proficiency_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Proficiency Icon.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2d/Proficiency_Icon.png/22px-Proficiency_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/2d/Proficiency_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <i>If you have <a href=\"/wiki/Proficiency\" title=\"Proficiency\">proficiency</a>, equip in <strong>main hand</strong> to gain:</i>\n</p>\n<dl>\n<dt><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Concussive_Smash\" title=\"Concussive Smash\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/57/Concussive_Smash_Icon.webp/40px-Concussive_Smash_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/57/Concussive_Smash_Icon.webp/60px-Concussive_Smash_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/57/Concussive_Smash_Icon.webp/80px-Concussive_Smash_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Concussive Smash\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/57/Concussive_Smash_Icon.webp/40px-Concussive_Smash_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/57/Concussive_Smash_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Concussive_Smash\" title=\"Concussive Smash\">Concussive Smash</a> (<span aria-label=\"Action\"><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/35px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/46px-Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Action\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span>)</dt>\n<dd>Hit an enemy with all your might to deal damage and possibly <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dazed_(Condition)\" title=\"Dazed (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a2/Dazed_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Dazed_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a2/Dazed_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Dazed_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a2/Dazed_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Dazed_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Daze\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a2/Dazed_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Dazed_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a2/Dazed_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Dazed_(Condition)\" title=\"Dazed (Condition)\">Daze</a> them. (<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/38px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Recharge: Short rest\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Recharge: <a href=\"/wiki/Short_rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Short rest\">Short rest</a>.)</dd>\n</dl></div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Shattered_Sanctum\" title=\"Shattered Sanctum\">Shattered Sanctum</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;338&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-21</span>: Carried by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Abdirak\" title=\"Abdirak\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/10/Portrait_Abdirak.png/25px-Portrait_Abdirak.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/10/Portrait_Abdirak.png/38px-Portrait_Abdirak.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/10/Portrait_Abdirak.png/50px-Portrait_Abdirak.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Abdirak\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/10/Portrait_Abdirak.png/25px-Portrait_Abdirak.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/10/Portrait_Abdirak.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Abdirak\" title=\"Abdirak\">Abdirak</a></li></ul>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>If this mace is purchased from Abdirak through his barter screen, it transfers back to him automatically when he needs to use it.</li></ul>\n\n<p><i>Regarding Willing Whip:</i></p>\n<ul><li>Due to the resistance granted by this passive, fractional damage received by the wielder is rounded down, and they take only <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-necrotic\">0~3</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Necrotic\" title=\"Necrotic\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Necrotic\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Necrotic\" title=\"Necrotic\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-necrotic\">Necrotic</span></a> damage. However, nearby allies take full damage.</li>\n<li><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-legendary\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Helldusk_Armour\" title=\"Helldusk Armour\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ae/Helldusk_Armour_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Helldusk_Armour_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ae/Helldusk_Armour_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Helldusk_Armour_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/ae/Helldusk_Armour_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Helldusk_Armour_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ae/Helldusk_Armour_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Helldusk_Armour_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ae/Helldusk_Armour_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Helldusk_Armour\" title=\"Helldusk Armour\">Helldusk Armour</a>, if used in conjunction with the above resistance, effectively negates all Necrotic damage otherwise inflicted upon the wielder by this passive.</li>\n<li>The area of effect is centred on the creature that is hit, and the radius is 2 m (7 ft).</li>\n<li>This feature is particularly useful against groupings of low-hit-point enemies that may otherwise have many opportunities to score <a href=\"/wiki/Critical_hit\" title=\"Critical hit\">critical hits</a> against the party.</li>\n<li>If <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lae%27zel\" title=\"Lae'zel\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/86/Portrait_Lae%27zel.png/25px-Portrait_Lae%27zel.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/86/Portrait_Lae%27zel.png/38px-Portrait_Lae%27zel.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/86/Portrait_Lae%27zel.png/50px-Portrait_Lae%27zel.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Lae'zel\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/86/Portrait_Lae%27zel.png/25px-Portrait_Lae%27zel.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/86/Portrait_Lae%27zel.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Lae%27zel\" title=\"Lae'zel\">Lae'zel</a> is in the party while fighting the murder of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shadow-Cursed_Raven\" title=\"Shadow-Cursed Raven\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f8/Portrait_Shadow-Cursed_Raven.png/25px-Portrait_Shadow-Cursed_Raven.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f8/Portrait_Shadow-Cursed_Raven.png/38px-Portrait_Shadow-Cursed_Raven.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f8/Portrait_Shadow-Cursed_Raven.png/50px-Portrait_Shadow-Cursed_Raven.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Shadow-Cursed Raven\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f8/Portrait_Shadow-Cursed_Raven.png/25px-Portrait_Shadow-Cursed_Raven.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f8/Portrait_Shadow-Cursed_Raven.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Shadow-Cursed_Raven\" title=\"Shadow-Cursed Raven\">Shadow-Cursed Ravens</a> on the <a href=\"/wiki/Ruined_Battlefield\" title=\"Ruined Battlefield\">Ruined Battlefield</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/Act_Two\" title=\"Act Two\">Act Two</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;30&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;114</span>, the area of effect damage from this passive may easily earn the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Soldier\" title=\"Soldier\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Background_Soldier_Icon.png/20px-Background_Soldier_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Background_Soldier_Icon.png/30px-Background_Soldier_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Background_Soldier_Icon.png/40px-Background_Soldier_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Soldier\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Background_Soldier_Icon.png/20px-Background_Soldier_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/ba/Background_Soldier_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Soldier\" title=\"Soldier\">Soldier</a>'s <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Soldier#Pentacrush\" title=\"Soldier\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png/20px-Inspiration_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png/30px-Inspiration_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png/40px-Inspiration_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Pentacrush\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png/20px-Inspiration_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Soldier#Pentacrush\" title=\"Soldier\">Pentacrush</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Inspiration\" title=\"Inspiration\">Inspiration</a>, while taking little to no damage in the process.</li>\n<li>Attacks which deal multiple instances of damage, such as the various <a href=\"/wiki/Smite\" title=\"Smite\">smite</a> spells or <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Booming_Blade\" title=\"Booming Blade\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Booming_Blade_Icon.webp/20px-Booming_Blade_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Booming_Blade_Icon.webp/30px-Booming_Blade_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Booming_Blade_Icon.webp/40px-Booming_Blade_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Booming Blade\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Booming_Blade_Icon.webp/20px-Booming_Blade_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Booming_Blade_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Booming_Blade\" title=\"Booming Blade\">Booming Blade</a>, trigger multiple instances of Willing Whip.\n<ul><li>Similarly, weapon attacks that target multiple creatures, such as <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Tiger%27s_Bloodlust\" title=\"Tiger's Bloodlust\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a3/Tiger%27s_Bloodlust_Icon.webp/20px-Tiger%27s_Bloodlust_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a3/Tiger%27s_Bloodlust_Icon.webp/30px-Tiger%27s_Bloodlust_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a3/Tiger%27s_Bloodlust_Icon.webp/40px-Tiger%27s_Bloodlust_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Tiger's Bloodlust\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a3/Tiger%27s_Bloodlust_Icon.webp/20px-Tiger%27s_Bloodlust_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a3/Tiger%27s_Bloodlust_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Tiger%27s_Bloodlust\" title=\"Tiger's Bloodlust\">Tiger's Bloodlust</a>, cause this passive to activate separately on each successful attack, potentially causing the wielder and all nearby creatures to take significant damage.</li></ul></li></ul>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n\n<p><i>Regarding Willing Whip:</i></p>\n<ul><li>Some damage riders like <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lightning_Charges_(Condition)\" title=\"Lightning Charges (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/47/Lightning_Charges_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Lightning_Charges_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/47/Lightning_Charges_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Lightning_Charges_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/47/Lightning_Charges_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Lightning_Charges_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Lightning Charges\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/47/Lightning_Charges_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Lightning_Charges_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/47/Lightning_Charges_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Lightning_Charges_(Condition)\" title=\"Lightning Charges (Condition)\">Lightning Charges</a> and <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Callous_Glow_Ring\" title=\"Callous Glow Ring\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/51/Ring_E_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Ring_E_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/51/Ring_E_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Ring_E_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/51/Ring_E_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Ring_E_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/51/Ring_E_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Ring_E_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/51/Ring_E_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Callous_Glow_Ring\" title=\"Callous Glow Ring\">Callous Glow Ring</a> are added both to regular attacks and to the Willing Whip area effect, so they also hurt the mace wielder.</li>\n<li>Creatures close to the one struck by this weapon take damage every time, but those on the border of its AoE radius sometimes do not.  This is especially noticeable with wide area attacks, such as <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Slashing_Flourish_(Melee)\" title=\"Slashing Flourish (Melee)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/37/Slashing_Flourish_Melee_Icon.webp/20px-Slashing_Flourish_Melee_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/37/Slashing_Flourish_Melee_Icon.webp/30px-Slashing_Flourish_Melee_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/37/Slashing_Flourish_Melee_Icon.webp/40px-Slashing_Flourish_Melee_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Slashing Flourish (Melee)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/37/Slashing_Flourish_Melee_Icon.webp/20px-Slashing_Flourish_Melee_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/37/Slashing_Flourish_Melee_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Slashing_Flourish_(Melee)\" title=\"Slashing Flourish (Melee)\">Slashing Flourish (Melee)</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>    \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"External_links\">External links</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Loviatar%27s_Scourge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/33px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/44px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Loviatar's Scourge\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Loviatar%27s_Scourge\">Loviatar's Scourge</a></span> on the <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Main_Page\">Forgotten Realms Wiki</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714195510\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.134 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.144 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 4615/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 99075/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 21662/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 2/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 4/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.033/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1698638/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%  109.857      1 -total\n 98.14%  107.819      1 Template:WeaponPage\n 25.14%   27.620     53 Template:Trim\n 22.33%   24.533     14 Template: